# Service level summary

For priority-1 incidents the response time is two (2) hours from the time the ticket is opened [[cite:obs-b3d2fbabad81b4bfb266bd389e63fc2505c88522 "For priority-1 incidents the response time is two (2) hours from the time the ticket is opened."]]. Priority-1 incidents are escalated to the on-call engineer through the pager rotation [[cite:obs-91ce36d9c07b25bc2bebd79936a4582620d4a5fa "Priority-1 incidents are escalated to the on-call engineer through the pager rotation."]].